<description>&lt;p&gt;The junta’s air force continues striking civilian sites, killing a pregnant woman in Mrauk-U and a Muslim youth in an IDP camp at Wirathani, while drone attacks hit the Tada-U airbase and landmines block displaced residents from returning to northern Kawkareik. Resistance forces have captured three military outposts near the Sagaing-Kachin border, expanding their territorial gains. The military is courting U.S. rare-earth investment to reduce dependence on China, while China seeks green stones from Myanmar and a Middle East energy shock is intensifying competition for crude. Myanmar summoned the German envoy over a controversial video, and ASEAN pressure on the junta is increasing. 2,332 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxOeGRlYnlQbHM3T3hGeWNXdHpuWWNnejNxWmVnbE1UTE1QLXFTa1BKRW9UUTdZTTJiQkxPVXR4cldabHRzdW9GUl9MbjF3YmR6czB4MUhiVWd0WFJyNXBXdVZ5U2lJdkJVOHZTMWVBY3oxbUtId1UxdENLNUVPYW1iUE5ROEpITjN1SmEzcUhuQjNBbXNiRzFYc3AwMkVRRUNnVVRxSTNOOVVVUHl0V3pGNmFLYXIwOUZY?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxPcFpwV1ZQVS1HN2tES0tBdk1aRWRfRGhlN1ZxVXlfcndUeF9CdlJqYVk5QWlSWl9qZXhMSEMzSHM3UkJtQ3BNclRJMWZRbTNoaHF6bFZvMlloSmg3RnU5MnFzVTdxWkdBTmduVHcwRE1hc1lTUkNGZi1wemhiQkVrWVhRSGVBNmZ3S0ltU2ZSTG91S1BY?oc=5&quot;&gt;Human Rights Watch&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiigFBVV95cUxOaUwyNlNuY19uNjFqelRENUQxQm9vOEQwYzZEbklMdFJfM19rLS01SklDWWFUamV1Ym9QMnJQTnQwSVdLX3VRdmh5alhONmdSWk93LVFYU3dJQ1pqY1BndkFZOTZqenQxT2pTWnNjRVpWbVhwaVBHUzh0Q2FPanN1bW9CcVloZ1hYTVE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Muslim Network TV&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxNN2RXMVBOVXdMeU